<!-- Detection and mitigation over time: one `<chart>` with two series. One value is one attribute
     (`<point value>`), and two `<series>` with the same labels in the same order group the bars and get a
     legend. In PPTX each bar is one shape.

     Bar height is a percentage `value ÷ axis max`, and the browser measures the pixels — which is why `h`
     is required (if the content set the chart's height, the reference would be circular). `unit` is the
     tail of the value label: "22" is data and "min" is notation, so it stays out of the value.

     Series colors follow the deck's color rule (001_cover): detection is where we were late, so `accent4`;
     mitigation is what we did, so `accent3`. The card on the right states the target — there is no
     vocabulary for a target line inside a chart, so the target stands beside it as a single number. -->
<slide id="detection" enter="rise">
  <text variant="kicker">Trend</text>
  <h2>Detection and mitigation are improving — still too slow</h2>
  <row gap="lg" grow="1" align="center">
    <chart type="bar" unit=" min" max="35" alt="Monthly average time to detect and mitigate — from 22 and 31 min in May to 12 and 17 min in this incident" grow="1" basis="0" h="420">
      <series name="Detect" fill="accent4">
        <point label="May" value="22"/>
        <point label="Jun" value="19"/>
        <point label="Jul" value="15"/>
        <point label="Aug" value="13"/>
        <point label="This incident" value="12"/>
      </series>
      <series name="Mitigate" fill="accent3">
        <point label="May" value="31"/>
        <point label="Jun" value="26"/>
        <point label="Jul" value="24"/>
        <point label="Aug" value="20"/>
        <point label="This incident" value="17"/>
      </series>
    </chart>
    <shape variant="stat-card" type="rounded-rect" fill="surface" w="280" pad="lg">
      <col gap="sm">
        <text variant="kicker" color="muted">Target</text>
        <text role="title" size="88" color="accent4">3<span size="36"> min</span></text>
        <text role="caption">1-min p99 alert + 2 min to confirm. Action 2 cuts this bar to a quarter.</text>
      </col>
    </shape>
  </row>
  <note>The trend is good, but we are still four times off the target. At the next review we add this month to the chart.</note>
</slide>
